Good day Refilwe,

I hope you and the team at Mzansi Plumbing are well.

Welcome to the October 2026 edition of the Kloof Electrical monthly newsletter for our customers.

Product news this month includes our new range of energy saving LED shop fittings and rechargeable inspection lamps. Both are ideal for site work during load shedding recovery and the summer storm season. Stock is available at our counter and we are happy to demonstrate them on request.

Our seasonal tip for October is to check outdoor wiring and plug seals before the summer rains arrive. Clear leaves from light fittings around the yard and test earth leakage units to keep staff and customers safe.

Thank you for reading. We appreciate your support and feedback for future editions.

If you no longer wish to receive this newsletter, please reply to this email with unsubscribe in the subject line and we will remove you from the list.

